    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You unnerve your enemies effortlessly with your dragon-like mien. Creatures who enter a 45-foot radius from you must make a saving throw against your Reign of Terror, without you needing to use the ability yourself. As Reign of Terror, they are immune to Reign of Terror for 1 day after making the saving throw regardless of the result. You can choose creatures to not be affected by Terrifying Presence.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">In addition, the circumstance bonus you gain for your Diplomacy checks to creatures who are affiliated with your Benefactor’s Domains also apply to your Intimidation checks against them.</span></p>"
